WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:06,330
Now that everyone is here, let’s listen well.

2
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:12,780
Xu Zhi, I haven't thanked you enough for being able to successfully enter the public service this time.

3
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:18,320
With just a little effort, you don't have to be stuck in the hospital all year round and feel bored. Relax your mind.

4
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:23,320
If you want to escape and return to the court in the future, I will naturally plan a way for you from Zhongguochen.

5
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:26,540
Then I would like to thank Xiao Shu in advance.

6
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:35,490
Yunlan, come. This is my brother's granddaughter, Ji Yunlan.

7
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,490
Her grandfather went away, so I took him over to stay for a few days.

8
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:41,580
Cousin, cousin.

9
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:47,680
Sister Yunlan, this is the girl from Shen Yue's family that the old lady mentioned that the old lady wanted to give to Shen Yue.

10
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:52,680
Shen Yue had so many cousins. He Qinhui left, and Ji Yunlan came.
